{"4955250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "N.E.O.N. HORIZON", "steam_appid": 4955250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mission was never meant to return.</strong><br>Build impossible ships. Survive 100 waves. Reach Horizon. <br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/f638de11f3d9ebce0e025b589725a08e.poster.avif?t=1788326090\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/f638de11f3d9ebce0e025b589725a08e.webm?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/f638de11f3d9ebce0e025b589725a08e.mp4?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than a century ago, humanity initiated <strong>Project N.E.O.N.</strong> — the <strong>Navigational Expedition for Observable Nothingness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the project was <strong>NH-017</strong>, an autonomous research station governed by artificial intelligence. It spent seventy-one years crossing interstellar space before reaching <strong>Horizon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What it found there changed the mission forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, cut off from Earth, NH-017 remotely commands its remaining combat vessels, sending them through hostile space in an attempt to reach <strong>Horizon</strong> and transmit a warning home.<br><strong>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 100 increasingly dangerous waves, evolve your ships through upgrades, relics, and powerful synergies, choose your route, and uncover what NH-017 discovered beyond <strong>Horizon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/96dcb16fe928ef568a66896a80c68cc7.poster.avif?t=1788326090\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/96dcb16fe928ef568a66896a80c68cc7.webm?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/96dcb16fe928ef568a66896a80c68cc7.mp4?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced sci-fi <strong>roguelike bullet hell</strong> gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle through <strong>100 handcrafted waves</strong> featuring elite enemies, mini-bosses, and multi-phase boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Command multiple unique ships, each offering a different combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build powerful combinations using <strong>upgrades, relics, and synergies</strong>, creating a different strategy every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose your route between battles, balancing risk and reward through events, shops, and branching paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock new ships, technologies, and permanent progression as your expedition advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Adapt to randomized rewards and build paths that make every expedition unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover the mystery waiting beyond <strong>Horizon</strong> and uncover the fate of Project <strong>N.E.O.N.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mission was never meant to return.</strong><br>Build impossible ships. Survive 100 waves. Reach Horizon. <br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/f638de11f3d9ebce0e025b589725a08e.poster.avif?t=1788326090\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/f638de11f3d9ebce0e025b589725a08e.webm?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/f638de11f3d9ebce0e025b589725a08e.mp4?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than a century ago, humanity initiated <strong>Project N.E.O.N.</strong> — the <strong>Navigational Expedition for Observable Nothingness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the project was <strong>NH-017</strong>, an autonomous research station governed by artificial intelligence. It spent seventy-one years crossing interstellar space before reaching <strong>Horizon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What it found there changed the mission forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, cut off from Earth, NH-017 remotely commands its remaining combat vessels, sending them through hostile space in an attempt to reach <strong>Horizon</strong> and transmit a warning home.<br><strong>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 100 increasingly dangerous waves, evolve your ships through upgrades, relics, and powerful synergies, choose your route, and uncover what NH-017 discovered beyond <strong>Horizon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/96dcb16fe928ef568a66896a80c68cc7.poster.avif?t=1788326090\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/96dcb16fe928ef568a66896a80c68cc7.webm?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955250/extras/96dcb16fe928ef568a66896a80c68cc7.mp4?t=1788326090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced sci-fi <strong>roguelike bullet hell</strong> gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle through <strong>100 handcrafted waves</strong> featuring elite enemies, mini-bosses, and multi-phase boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Command multiple unique ships, each offering a different combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build powerful combinations using <strong>upgrades, relics, and synergies</strong>, creating a different strategy every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose your route between battles, balancing risk and reward through events, shops, and branching paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock new ships, technologies, and permanent progression as your expedition advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Adapt to randomized rewards and build paths that make every expedition unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover the mystery waiting beyond <strong>Horizon</strong> and uncover the fate of Project <strong>N.E.O.N.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Survive 100 perilous waves in a sci-fi roguelite shooter where every decision transforms your ship. Upgrade its systems, discover powerful relics, create unique synergies, and uncover the mystery awaiting you at Horizon.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s